### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/bsscore/health

### Login: Mona (OK)
POST http://localhost:8080/bsscore/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

msisdn=01012345678&pin=1234

### Login: wrong PIN (AUTH001)
POST http://localhost:8080/bsscore/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

msisdn=01012345678&pin=9999

### Login: suspended line (AUTH002)
POST http://localhost:8080/bsscore/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

msisdn=01234567890&pin=1111

### My profile (needs a login first)
GET http://localhost:8080/bss-core/api/subscriber/me

### Logout
POST http://localhost:8080/bss-core/api/auth/logout

### Logout
POST http://localhost:8080/bsscore/api/auth/logout